{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FastSleep Baby White Noise 是一款專為新生兒與嬰幼兒設計的白噪音助眠應用，適合 0 至 18 個月大的嬰兒使用，也讓新手父母在夜間安撫寶寶時更輕鬆。目前限時免費，原價 US $5.99。</p>\n\n<h2>白噪音助眠功能</h2>\n<p>內建多種專為嬰兒設計的助眠聲音，包括模擬子宮環境的 Whooshy、Shhhh、吹風機、溪流、鳥鳴與雷雨等，可按年齡選用合適音效。搭配睡眠計時器，有助建立規律作息；採用快取技術，無需網絡也能離線播放，而且完全沒有廣告或推送通知，讓父母在夜間安心使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-353-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-354-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-355-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-356-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-357-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FastSleep Baby White Noise</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T05:18:52.713068+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}